{"sha": "c8fa0f5486b285d044c9baf9436b7669560468884b9ad1cc7c22a9d638cd7aca", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[xscale=1.75, yscale=0.42]", "  \\draw[->, thin] (-2.7,0) -- (2.8,0) node[below] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->, thin] (0,-4.6) -- (0,4.9) node[left] {$y$};", "  \\draw[dashed, gray] (-1,-4.4) -- (-1,4.6);", "  \\draw[dashed, gray] (1,-4.4) -- (1,4.6);", "  \\draw[omThm, thin] (-2.6,1.5) -- (2.7,1.5)", "    node[above right, font=\\small, pos=0.02] {$y = \\lambda$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=-2.6:-1.31, samples=80, smooth]", "    plot (\\x, {1/(\\x+1) + 1/\\x + 1/(\\x-1)});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=-0.83:-0.20, samples=120, smooth]", "    plot (\\x, {1/(\\x+1) + 1/\\x + 1/(\\x-1)});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=0.20:0.83, samples=120, smooth]", "    plot (\\x, {1/(\\x+1) + 1/\\x + 1/(\\x-1)});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=1.31:2.7, samples=80, smooth]", "    plot (\\x, {1/(\\x+1) + 1/\\x + 1/(\\x-1)});", "  \\fill[omThm] (-0.715,1.5) circle (0.045 and 0.19);", "  \\fill[omThm] (0.40,1.5) circle (0.045 and 0.19);", "  \\fill[omThm] (2.3,1.5) circle (0.045 and 0.19);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 函数 $F(x) = \\frac1{x+1} + \\frac1x +", "\\frac1{x-1}$，属\\cref{exo:b1:fractions:12}所述类型，严格", "递减于其极点 $-1, 0, 1$ 所分隔的各区间上，", "（虚线）。每条水平线 $\\lambda > 0$ 恰与第一个极点右侧的每个区间相交", "一次（圆点标出）：", "方程 $F = \\lambda$ 的解与极点相互交错。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:1}", "在 $\\R$ 上分解：$\\dfrac{1}{X^2 - 1}$；", "$\\;\\dfrac{X}{X^2 - 3X + 2}$；$\\;\\dfrac{X^2 + 1}{X(X-1)}$ \\emph{（注意", "整式部分）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:2}", "在 $\\R$ 上分解：$\\dfrac{1}{X(X^2 + 1)}$ 与", "$\\dfrac{X^3}{X^2 + X + 1}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:3}", "分解 $\\dfrac{1}{X^2(X - 1)}$ 与 $\\dfrac{X + 1}{(X - 1)^3}$", "\\emph{（对第二式，令 $Y = X - 1$）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:4}", "先在 $\\C$ 上、再在 $\\R$ 上分解：$\\dfrac{1}{X^4 - 1}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:5}", "在 $\\R$ 上分解：$\\dfrac{X^2}{(X^2 + 1)^2}$，并由此求", "函数 $x \\mapsto \\dfrac{x^2}{(x^2+1)^2}$ 的一个原函数，已知", "$\\int \\frac{\\dd x}{(x^2+1)^2} = \\frac12\\bigl(\\arctan x +", "\\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\bigr) + C$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:6}", "对 $n \\in \\N^*$，分解 $F_n = \\dfrac{n!}{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+n)}$", "\\emph{（单极点位于 $0, -1, \\dots, -n$；用遮盖法", "并识别出二项式系数）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:7}", "利用\\cref{exo:b1:poly:11}中的恒等式，取 $P = X^n - 1$，", "证明下式：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{X - \\omega^k} = \\frac{n X^{n-1}}{X^n - 1},", "\\qquad \\omega = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/n},", "\\]", "并在 $X = 2$、$n = 4$ 时计算两边，以作检验。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:8}", "分解 $\\dfrac{1}{k(k+1)(k+2)}$，并计算", "\\[", "S_n = \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{k(k+1)(k+2)},", "\\qquad\\text{再求}\\qquad", "\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} S_n .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:9}", "设 $P \\in \\R[X]$ 为 $n$ 次首一多项式，它有 $n$ 个互异实根", "$x_1 < \\dots < x_n$。证明下式：", "\\[", "\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{P'(x_i)} = 0 \\quad (n \\geq 2),", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{x_i^{\\,n-1}}{P'(x_i)} = 1 .", "\\]", "\\emph{提示：对 $\\frac{X^m}{P}$（$m \\leq n - 1$）作分解，并考察", "无穷远处系数的衰减 --- 或", "利用拉格朗日插值（见\\cref{thm:b1:poly:lagrange}），对单项式 $X^m$ 在", "节点 $x_i$ 上作插值。}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:10}", "将 $\\dfrac{1}{X(X+1)^2}$ 在 $\\R$ 上分解。承认", "$\\sum_{k \\geq 1} \\frac1{k^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$（已在", "本章周末问题中证明），推出", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{n(n+1)^2} = 2 - \\frac{\\pi^2}{6} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:fractions:11}", "在 $\\R$ 上分解：$\\dfrac{1}{(X^2+1)(X^2+4)}$，再分解", "$\\dfrac{X^2}{(X^2+1)(X^2+4)}$。\\emph{提示：两个分母都是", "关于 $X^2$ 的多项式：先分解 $\\frac1{(Y+1)(Y+4)}$。}", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}